  "title": "Water and Jug Problem",
  "summary": "Given two jugs with capacities x and y liters, determine if reaching a target amount of water in both jugs is possible using the operations: filling either jug, emptying either jug, or pouring water from one jug to the other until the receiving jug is full or the transferring jug is empty.",
  "statement": "Given two jugs with capacities x and y liters, determine if reaching a target amount of water in both jugs is possible using the operations: filling either jug, emptying either jug, or pouring water from one jug to the other until the receiving jug is full or the transferring jug is empty.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= x, y, target <= 1000. Both jugs begin empty; the supply is unlimited.",
    "Allowed actions: fill one jug completely, empty one jug, or pour until the source is empty or the destination is full.",
    "The goal is target liters TOTAL across both jugs, not necessarily in one jug."
